# Slink notes

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:kino, "~> 0.16.0"},
  {:kino_db, "~> 0.3.0"},
  {:postgrex, "~> 0.18"},
  {:kino_explorer, "~> 0.1.20"},
  {:merquery, "~> 0.3.0"}
])
```

